{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國聯合航空控股公司表示，已解決影響其離港航班的大規模系統故障。這是近期美國航空業遭遇的最新一起技術故障事件。美聯航在一份聲明中表示：「雖然部分航班出現延誤，但正在飛行中的航班以及美聯航快運（United Express）航班均未受到影響。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586718.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.950380+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:10:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"6dd29ad89c003d470f3f8ace61fa042e57abd849c1216be320a0df3112479b9b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}